                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Pearson to Mr.
                            Hay.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Legation</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Teheran</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1905-01-03"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">January 3,
                    1905</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. Pearson reports the payment of the equivalent of $30,000 gold indemnity for
                    the murder of Mr. Labaree.)</p>
            </div>
